      <h1 id="fish-title">Maize Somatic Chromosome Painting &amp; FISH Karyotypes</h1>
      <p class="mgdb-hero-description">
        Multicolor fluorescence in situ hybridization \(FISH\) chromosome painting maps across 14 diverse maize inbred lines and high-resolution B73 vs. Mo17 somatic karyotyping using repetitive DNA probe mixtures.
      </p>

